  tutorialEnabled: 1
  instructionsTitle: Welcome
  instructionsText: 'In this study you will walk along line graphs laid out on the
    floor. Each graph shows a household''s daily energy use over one month.


    In
    each round you will: walk the graph from the green Start marker to the End marker
    and look at the values; do a short counting task; walk the shape again from memory
    with the graph hidden; then answer a few questions about the values.


    In
    some rounds sounds and objects around you change with the values. After each
    part of the study you will answer a short questionnaire.


    We start with
    a short tutorial so you can practise. The tutorial is not scored.'
  tutorialCompleteTitle: Tutorial complete
  tutorialCompleteText: You have now completed the tutorial. The experiment starts
    next.
  completeText: Thank you! You can now remove the headset. The researcher will give
    you a laptop for four short open-ended questions.
